#!/bin/sh
# No-op maintainer script.
#
# Historical note: this preinst used to bump install_time in
# /etc/tollgate/install.json via jq. That was fragile and redundant:
#
#   - at the time of the incident the recipes had dropped their runtime
#     DEPENDS, so a bare `jq` call could be missing on an upgraded box
#     and aborted the upgrade — and the aborted opkg transaction then
#     orphan-removed the runtime deps (nodogsplash et al.). The dep
#     contract now lives in the packaging recipes (packaging/Makefile,
#     packaging/local-build-ipk.sh, the generated ngit shards) and is
#     fenced by tests/packaging/package-nodogsplash-dependency_test.sh.
#     Repro + forensics:
#     https://github.com/Amperstrand/tollgate-module-basic-go/issues/93
#   - The binary owns install.json (config_manager.EnsureDefaultInstall)
#     and stamps install_time itself when it is zero/unset.
#
# Keep the file as an explicit no-op so the packaging contract is visible.

exit 0
